    "body": "This particular span noise is caused by an out-of-date pygments. It turned out that _my_ pygments was out of date, and `pip install --upgrade pygments` made my bikeshed runs match yours. I've been avoiding the problem recently by having TravisCI use https://api.csswg.org/bikeshed/ to build specs for me: https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth/blob/master/deploy.sh\n",
